#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Cryptography Engine
#  File: cryptography_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS cryptography engine responsible for:
#      • hashing (SHA‑256, SHA‑512)
#      • HMAC signatures
#      • symmetric encryption/decryption
#      • key generation & registry
#      • integrity verification
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Key Management](ca://s?q=Explain_Crypto_Key_Management)
#    - [Hashing](ca://s?q=Explain_Crypto_Hashing)
#    - [HMAC Signatures](ca://s?q=Explain_Crypto_HMAC)
#    - [Symmetric Encryption](ca://s?q=Explain_Crypto_Symmetric_Encryption)
#    - [Integrity Verification](ca://s?q=Explain_Crypto_Integrity_Verification)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - generate_key(name, length)
#         Creates cryptographic key.
#
#    - sha256(data), sha512(data)
#         Computes cryptographic hashes.
#
#    - hmac_sign(key_name, data)
#         Produces HMAC signature.
#
#    - encrypt(key_name, data)
#         Encrypts data (XOR placeholder).
#
#    - decrypt(key_name, ciphertext)
#         Decrypts data (XOR placeholder).
#
#    - verify_hmac(key_name, data, signature)
#         Validates HMAC signature.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns cryptography engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  KEY STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "KEY-XXXX",
#      "name": "system.master",
#      "length": 32,
#      "timestamp": <epoch>
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  RELATED MODULES:
